    // ---- Shields ------------------------------------------------------------------------
    // The Ward: a veil thrown from a small caged star (`models::regency::ward`), drawn in
    // pinch fusion's prism over a lattice of red-tinged triangles (faction.ron
    // `shield_look`). It bends ARC's Aegis the Regency way: a tighter field, but denser,
    // taking more and filling faster, for a little more of everything. Tech 2, and it
    // upgrades in place to Ward II, whose field swells out once the refit is done. Like every
    // shield it draws energy, and drops in any stall.
    (
        key: "regency_t2_shield",
        name: "Ward",
        role: "Shield Generator", title: "Shield",
        tech: 2,
        categories: ["Land", "Defense", "Shield"],
